docs {
  # Instrument Match — GET Info

  Public endpoint. Returns usage information when the URL is opened in a browser.
  No API key required.

  Expected response:

  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "API is running",
    "method": "POST",
    "endpoint": "/api/instrument-match",
    "usage": {
      "content_type": "application/json",
      "header": "X-API-KEY: <your-key>",
      "example": {
        "instType": "PT"
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
